# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# The look: a window casts a shadow on the desk, its corners are round,
# and a menu is a card with a shadow of its own.
wait 25
note below the window's foot the backdrop is in shadow: darker than
note the desk, lighter than the window's own hairline
expect-pixel 275 342 1c3854
note the bottom-right corner is cut: neither panel nor plain desk
expect-pixel 503 339 1c3853
note past the shadow's reach the desk is itself
expect-pixel 275 360 336698
click 71 76
wait 8
shot /tmp/trk_look.png
note the menu's corner is cut the same way
expect-pixel 54 421 4d6379
note and the window's panel beside the menu is in the menu's shadow
expect-pixel 198 300 cdcdcd
key Escape
wait 4
quit
